<Namespace Name="Android.App.ContentSafety">
  <Docs>
    <summary>Provides APIs to request content classification and receive its result.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Use <see cref="T:Android.App.ContentSafety.ClassifiableContent.Builder" /> to describe the content and <see cref="M:Android.App.ContentSafety.ContentSafetyManager.RequestContentClassification(Android.App.ContentSafety.ClassifiableContent,Java.Util.Concurrent.IExecutor,Android.App.ContentSafety.IContentClassificationCallback)" /> to submit it. Implement <see cref="T:Android.App.ContentSafety.IContentClassificationCallback" /> to receive a <see cref="T:Android.App.ContentSafety.ContentClassificationResult" />.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
</Namespace>
